==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Birthday Cake]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~33.33 seconds<sup>60f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Birthday Cake #3 seems to be a tough opponent (it's considered [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]]). Just spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cats]], [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lions]] and the stage will be a breeze. Bring [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Hurricat]] or [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|critical hitters]] to finish the stage faster.

